## Model card

- **Name:** Gemini 3.7 Flash (Google; "High" reasoning variant surfaced on Artificial Analysis)
- **Short description:** Google's Gemini 3.7 Flash reasoning model (succeeded by newer Gemini 3.8 Flash in AA tracking), an efficient multimodal model with broad input modalities. Proprietary.
- **Provider / access:** Google AI Studio and Google Vertex AI (per OpenRouter/provider listings); served via OpenRouter as `google/gemini-3.7-flash`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Released 2026-08-13 (per Artificial Analysis). Knowledge/training cutoff not explicitly stated on fetched sources.
- **IDs:** `google/gemini-3.7-flash` (OpenRouter). No free-tier ID verified.
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 tokens (per Artificial Analysis). Max output not explicitly specified on fetched pages.
- **Modalities:** Text, image, speech, and video input; text output. Reasoning yes (AA lists as reasoning model). Tool use supported (OpenRouter advertises tools/tool_choice).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** Varies by provider/tier on OpenRouter (examples shown from ~$0.375/$1.875 to ~$1.35/$6.75 per 1M input/output). AA summary lists $0.75 / 1M input and $3.75 / 1M output. Paid, competitively priced.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary (parameter count and detailed architecture not publicly disclosed).

